window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A bear-shifter on a mission. A human leader with secrets. Together, they must rewrite the fate of two worlds.</p> <p>When ancient enemies collide, can love bridge the divide or will it ignite the ultimate betrayal?</p> <p>She’s a shifter determined to protect humanity’s last hope. He’s a human leader who doesn’t believe in hope. Sparks—and danger—fly.</p> <p>Survival, love, and trust: the only weapons in a battle against the greed that could destroy them all.</p> <p>In the heart of the forest, a forbidden connection between human and shifter could change the world—or end it.</p>"; 
